'''Blacephalon''' (Japanese: '''ズガドーン''' ''Zugadoon'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

