==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Blacephalon|104}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*The '''Beat Punk''' attack is named after {{wp|ja:ビートロック|beat punk}}, a genre of music. The name may have been chosen as beat punk is characterized by the usage of loud, hard-set snares, thematically fitting {{p|Blacephalon}}'s fireworks design.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

